"text": "HE ASKS THEM TO PUT HIS FATHER BACK ON THE THRONE",
"garble": "...FATHER... THRONE... HELP?"
}, {
"text": "TWO HUNDRED THOUSAND MARKS",
"garble": "...TWO HUNDRED... THOUSAND?"
}, {
"text": "FOOD FOR THE WHOLE HOST FOR A YEAR",
